 Sayoko get into a fight about who was responsible for letting Madoka become a Magical Girl.", "nc": 145, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": false}, {"path": "/@saigokudou/works/2", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creator_id": 202406, "client_id": 2495657, "vtt_url": null, "thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1bccf32030dfdb9a6df853290859c62", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=a1bccf32030dfdb9a6df853290859c62, https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=7b8af3f3003bc32851c000e62f60f6e0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=09e0b48113363f51b9636d0d7b8dbc2e 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=867535f608a696627268d31a4d5d0aca", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=867535f608a696627268d31a4d5d0aca, https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=9d58160c59e37ab090fa4207823f216f 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c4c86cc8/uploads/origins/9165d16b-3a97-452b-a881-ccb37e665645?bg=%23fff&a